ategories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Scai7ZFQLGAInHruaWFRoA","review_id":"2858zQnuaro1BpeKRw2mgQ","date":"2018-07-18T22:57:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9377195835113525,"text_excerpt":"Highly recommend this place! It's right off of Bourbon Street but it feels like a world away! It was such a nice escape from the chaos. It's a bit fancy but we went in wearing street close and the treated us with the upmost respect! We ordered Ramos Gin Fizz and the were delicious. We went back two days later because the bar tender told us about $6 absinthe during happy hour. He explained how it worked and made it in front of us. (It was better than the old absinthe bar on bourbon street and a 1/3 of the price) We had multiple mangers check on us and received amazing service. We also purchased happy hour appetizers that were delicious! I wish I remembered the bar tenders name because it w..."},{"business_id":"Scai7ZFQLGAInHruaWFRoA","review_id":"zp1XUQz1m6ipwzgaP7n8Ww","date":"2016-08-13T23:16:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9351553320884705,"text_excerpt":"Great spot to stop in for a first-rate cocktail. Great, old world ambiance, and the bartenders are a lot of fun. We had some snacks, of which the shrimp toast was the best. If you want to escape the craziness and tourist crap on Bourbon, stop in here. Ahhhhhh..."},{"business_id":"Scai7ZFQLGAInHruaWFRoA","review_id":"Gftol8yBSBMzP6mgcb2RcQ","date":"2014-09-02T21:29:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.934701681137085,"text_excerpt":"Ah yes, come for happy hour! Those $3 pimm's cups are to die for and the bartender Paul is oh so charming. Stay for the mussel's and try all three varieties. My favorite ones are the spicy mussels. Such a beautiful bar and don' t forget to visit the outdoor courtyard as well. The list of cocktails are amazing and you better try some! The Letite de Onca is a must try with its cachaca \"prata.\" You definitely won't be disappointed with the Empire Bar."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Scai7ZFQLGAInHruaWFRoA","photo_id":"n0fK8ZBE19chKzQBl8HTTA","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/n0fK8ZBE19chKzQBl8HTTA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.875461220741272},{"business_id":"Scai7ZFQLGAInHruaWFRoA","photo_id":"MRf0k_aqK6qMisaAroG9Qg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/MRf0k_aqK6qMisaAroG9Qg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8746106028556824},{"business_id":"Scai7ZFQLGAInHruaWFRoA","photo_id":"SCRo0jkFyRkD8rPzM-BVPg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/SCRo0jkFyRkD8rPzM-BVPg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8579344153404236},{"business_id":"Scai7ZFQLGAInHruaWFRoA","photo_id":"HW4wVn_ZTWVhGywAdvDa_Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HW4wVn_ZTWVhGywAdvDa_Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8500098586082458},{"business_id":"Scai7ZFQLGAInHruaWFRoA","photo_id":"7KRshy1o7wcz10FOLScuXg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7KRshy1o7wcz10FOLScuXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8099952936172485}]},"notebook_case":null}
